1
00:00:00,147 --> 00:00:02,684
You take ONE giant slurp

2
00:00:02,684 --> 00:00:03,860
of milkshake...

3
00:00:03,860 --> 00:00:05,807
and then your forehead...

4
00:00:05,847 --> 00:00:07,310
FREEZES!

5
00:00:07,617 --> 00:00:08,649
Your forehead.

6
00:00:08,649 --> 00:00:11,467
The milkshake went in your MOUTH.

7
00:00:11,520 --> 00:00:12,850
That's brain freeze.

8
00:00:12,850 --> 00:00:14,203
Doctors call it...

9
00:00:14,203 --> 00:00:15,600
sphenopalatine

10
00:00:15,600 --> 00:00:17,774
ganglioneuralgia.

11
00:00:18,650 --> 00:00:20,833
Let's just stick with brain freeze.

12
00:00:20,880 --> 00:00:22,066
So what's going on?

13
00:00:22,066 --> 00:00:24,062
The cold hits the roof of your mouth,

14
00:00:24,062 --> 00:00:26,100
and the blood vessels up there panic.

15
00:00:26,100 --> 00:00:27,615
They squeeze tight...

16
00:00:27,615 --> 00:00:29,333
then fling wide open.

17
00:00:29,386 --> 00:00:30,420
In one study,

18
00:00:30,420 --> 00:00:32,165
blood came rushing into an artery

19
00:00:32,165 --> 00:00:33,576
at the front of the brain...

20
00:00:33,576 --> 00:00:34,830
and the pain lasted

21
00:00:34,830 --> 00:00:37,190
just as long as the rush.

22
00:00:37,389 --> 00:00:38,414
Scientists think your body

23
00:00:38,414 --> 00:00:40,075
is flooding in warm blood

24
00:00:40,075 --> 00:00:41,348
to protect your brain.

25
00:00:41,348 --> 00:00:42,518
It just...

26
00:00:42,518 --> 00:00:43,433
overdoes it.

27
00:00:43,469 --> 00:00:44,278
The twist?

28
00:00:44,278 --> 00:00:46,524
The pain travels up a big nerve

29
00:00:46,524 --> 00:00:48,036
in your face...

30
00:00:48,036 --> 00:00:50,230
and your brain blames the wrong spot.

31
00:00:50,230 --> 00:00:51,333
Your forehead.

32
00:00:51,380 --> 00:00:53,134
Does gulping make it worse?

33
00:00:53,134 --> 00:00:55,405
A thirteen-year-old tested it!

34
00:00:55,410 --> 00:00:57,613
Ice cream in five seconds...

35
00:00:57,613 --> 00:00:58,967
or in thirty.

36
00:00:59,010 --> 00:01:01,423
The gulpers got twice the headaches.

37
00:01:01,423 --> 00:01:03,223
And it got published...

38
00:01:03,223 --> 00:01:05,033
in a real medical journal.

39
00:01:05,067 --> 00:01:05,890
The fix?

40
00:01:05,890 --> 00:01:07,040
Press your tongue to the roof

41
00:01:07,040 --> 00:01:08,010
of your mouth,

42
00:01:08,010 --> 00:01:09,667
and warm it back up.

43
00:01:09,700 --> 00:01:11,440
Or, you know...

44
00:01:11,977 --> 00:01:13,613
just slow down.

